spec PushArchive.tla
check INVARIANTS CommittedTail HalfOpenDay StableNewestOrder PageAndLookahead
check PROPERTIES OnlyDeliveryCompletes
reach Trimmed | cap-1
reach CompletedWithPending | cap-1
reach FailedButCompleted | cap-1
reach EqualTimestamp | cap-3
reach DayBoundary | cap-3
reach ExtraRow | cap-3
reach SecondPage | cap-3
run cap-1 | Cap=1 PageSize=1 Count=2
run cap-3 | Cap=3 PageSize=2 Count=5
